Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:05.40,VO,,0,0,0,,One full lap of Gift No.188.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:09.44,VO,,0,0,0,,One road, start to start, a figure eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:15.82,VO,,0,0,0,,Two clicks in: coins, heart, stations, fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.22,0:00:19.31,VO,,0,0,0,,Then the camera settles behind his shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.71,0:00:25.55,VO,,0,0,0,,Here, the road doubles back. Nothing marks it but the road itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:28.04,VO,,0,0,0,,He keeps the way home for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:30.86,VO,,0,0,0,,The price is that no one remembers him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.26,0:00:35.08,VO,,0,0,0,,Space, and the station asks you to remember a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.80,0:00:42.49,VO,,0,0,0,,You take a shard for it. One of five.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:46.72,VO,,0,0,0,,Two more visits there before it gives anything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:53.58,VO,,0,0,0,,And you are allowed to be late. That is the rule of the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.98,0:00:59.17,VO,,0,0,0,,Nothing here can kill you. Composure only falls and never locks:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.57,0:01:04.16,VO,,0,0,0,,no enemy, no fail state, no timer you can lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:10.32,VO,,0,0,0,,The road keeps changing its mind. Pines, then bamboo,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:17.01,VO,,0,0,0,,then open ground, a pavilion on the rise, and towers far off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:23.94,VO,,0,0,0,,Paper, ink, a seal and an envelope wait at the bottom of the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.34,0:01:27.64,VO,,0,0,0,,All of it gets pressed into one postcard at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:32.39,VO,,0,0,0,,Every building on this route is built in code,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:38.25,VO,,0,0,0,,and the road itself downloads no texture files at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:45.45,VO,,0,0,0,,The lap comes back to where it started. One shard, four more waiting.